  "seconds": 294.71,
  "cues": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 2.205,
      "startFrame": 6,
      "endFrame": 66,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "You think you choose what you watch."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 3.005,
      "end": 4.968,
      "startFrame": 90,
      "endFrame": 149,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "But most of your last ten videos?"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 5.768,
      "end": 7.88,
      "startFrame": 173,
      "endFrame": 236,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "A machine probably picked them."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 12.016,
      "startFrame": 266,
      "endFrame": 360,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "Hi, I'm Spark. Let's open that machine up."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 12.816,
      "end": 15.013,
      "startFrame": 384,
      "endFrame": 450,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "By the end, you'll know what it reads,"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 15.813,
      "end": 18.011,
      "startFrame": 474,
      "endFrame": 540,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "how it picks from a mountain of videos,"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 18.811,
      "end": 20.965,
      "startFrame": 564,
      "endFrame": 629,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "why your feed can shrink around you,"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 21.765,
      "end": 23.877,
      "startFrame": 653,
      "endFrame": 716,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "and three taps that retrain it."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 24.877,
      "end": 27.928,
      "startFrame": 746,
      "endFrame": 838,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Picture this. You open the app for one video."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 28.728,
      "end": 31.032,
      "startFrame": 862,
      "endFrame": 931,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Just one. You know exactly which."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 31.832,
      "end": 34.584,
      "startFrame": 955,
      "endFrame": 1038,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "It ends, and the next one is already there."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 35.384,
      "end": 37.133,
      "startFrame": 1062,
      "endFrame": 1114,
      "words": 4,
      "text": "Then another. And another."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 37.933,
      "end": 40.408,
      "startFrame": 1138,
      "endFrame": 1212,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Forty minutes later, check the counter."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 41.208,
      "end": 43.619,
      "startFrame": 1236,
      "endFrame": 1309,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "Choices you actually made? One."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 44.419,
      "end": 46.701,
      "startFrame": 1333,
      "endFrame": 1401,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "Every other video was offered to you."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 47.501,
      "end": 50.339,
      "startFrame": 1425,
      "endFrame": 1510,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "By the home feed. By the up next list."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 51.139,
      "end": 54.253,
      "startFrame": 1534,
      "endFrame": 1628,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "Back in twenty eighteen, YouTube's product chief"
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 55.053,
      "end": 57.357,
      "startFrame": 1652,
      "endFrame": 1721,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "reportedly said about seventy percent"
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 58.157,
      "end": 60.867,
      "startFrame": 1745,
      "endFrame": 1826,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "of watch time came from recommendations."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 61.667,
      "end": 63.843,
      "startFrame": 1850,
      "endFrame": 1915,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "So who's doing all that choosing?"
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 64.843,
      "end": 67.595,
      "startFrame": 1945,
      "endFrame": 2028,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "Most people think it just shows what's popular."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 68.395,
      "end": 70.464,
      "startFrame": 2052,
      "endFrame": 2114,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Or that it only counts views."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 71.264,
      "end": 74.293,
      "startFrame": 2138,
      "endFrame": 2229,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "But YouTube's own help page lists the signals."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 75.093,
      "end": 76.907,
      "startFrame": 2253,
      "endFrame": 2307,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "And they're mostly about you."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 77.707,
      "end": 80.117,
      "startFrame": 2331,
      "endFrame": 2404,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "Signal one: your watch history."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 80.917,
      "end": 82.667,
      "startFrame": 2428,
      "endFrame": 2480,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "Two: what you search for."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 83.467,
      "end": 85.877,
      "startFrame": 2504,
      "endFrame": 2576,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Three: the channels you subscribe to."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 86.677,
      "end": 89.365,
      "startFrame": 2600,
      "endFrame": 2681,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "Four and five: your likes and dislikes."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 90.165,
      "end": 93.131,
      "startFrame": 2705,
      "endFrame": 2794,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "Six: every time you tap \"Not interested.\""
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 93.931,
      "end": 95.936,
      "startFrame": 2818,
      "endFrame": 2878,
      "words": 4,
      "text": "Seven: \"Don't recommend channel.\""
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 96.736,
      "end": 98.613,
      "startFrame": 2902,
      "endFrame": 2958,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "And eight is the sneaky one."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 99.413,
      "end": 102.101,
      "startFrame": 2982,
      "endFrame": 3063,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "Sometimes, it asks you to rate a video."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 102.901,
      "end": 105.995,
      "startFrame": 3087,
      "endFrame": 3180,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Why ask, if it already knows what you watched?"
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 106.795,
      "end": 109.525,
      "startFrame": 3204,
      "endFrame": 3286,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Because watch time can't tell if you were happy."
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 110.325,
      "end": 113.056,
      "startFrame": 3310,
      "endFrame": 3392,
      "words": 10,
      "text": "You can watch something for an hour and hate it."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 113.856,
      "end": 116.459,
      "startFrame": 3416,
      "endFrame": 3494,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "So the survey checks the machine's own guess."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 117.259,
      "end": 119.179,
      "startFrame": 3518,
      "endFrame": 3575,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "It's not reading your mind."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 119.979,
      "end": 121.728,
      "startFrame": 3599,
      "endFrame": 3652,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "It's reading what you do."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 122.728,
      "end": 125.011,
      "startFrame": 3682,
      "endFrame": 3750,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "But knowing you is only half the job."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 125.811,
      "end": 127.475,
      "startFrame": 3774,
      "endFrame": 3824,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "It still has to choose."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 128.275,
      "end": 130.323,
      "startFrame": 3848,
      "endFrame": 3910,
      "words": 4,
      "text": "Here's a simplified picture."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 131.123,
      "end": 133.981,
      "startFrame": 3934,
      "endFrame": 4019,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Think of a talent show with an endless line."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 134.781,
      "end": 139.325,
      "startFrame": 4043,
      "endFrame": 4180,
      "words": 10,
      "text": "In a twenty sixteen paper, YouTube engineers described two steps."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 140.125,
      "end": 142.835,
      "startFrame": 4204,
      "endFrame": 4285,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "Step one: from an enormous pile of videos,"
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 143.635,
      "end": 146.003,
      "startFrame": 4309,
      "endFrame": 4380,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "grab a few hundred that might fit you."
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 146.803,
      "end": 149.405,
      "startFrame": 4404,
      "endFrame": 4482,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Step two: give every one of those a score."
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 150.205,
      "end": 152.531,
      "startFrame": 4506,
      "endFrame": 4576,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "Only the top few make the final."
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 153.331,
      "end": 154.611,
      "startFrame": 4600,
      "endFrame": 4638,
      "words": 3,
      "text": "That's your screen."
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 155.411,
      "end": 157.501,
      "startFrame": 4662,
      "endFrame": 4725,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "So what was that score chasing?"
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 158.301,
      "end": 160.883,
      "startFrame": 4749,
      "endFrame": 4826,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "Not clicks. Clicks reward clickbait,"
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 161.683,
      "end": 163.709,
      "startFrame": 4850,
      "endFrame": 4911,
      "words": 5,
      "text": "videos people don't even finish."
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 164.509,
      "end": 167.667,
      "startFrame": 4935,
      "endFrame": 5030,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "The paper aimed for expected watch time instead."
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 168.467,
      "end": 172.52,
      "startFrame": 5054,
      "endFrame": 5176,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "And today, YouTube says surveys help measure satisfaction too."
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 173.32,
      "end": 175.987,
      "startFrame": 5200,
      "endFrame": 5280,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "So the race isn't \"most popular wins.\""
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 176.787,
      "end": 179.219,
      "startFrame": 5304,
      "endFrame": 5377,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "It's \"most likely to keep you watching.\""
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 180.219,
      "end": 182.608,
      "startFrame": 5407,
      "endFrame": 5478,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "And here's the part nobody tells you."
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 183.408,
      "end": 186.523,
      "startFrame": 5502,
      "endFrame": 5596,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "That race runs again every time you come back,"
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 187.323,
      "end": 189.392,
      "startFrame": 5620,
      "endFrame": 5682,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "using what you did last time."
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 190.192,
      "end": 193.904,
      "startFrame": 5706,
      "endFrame": 5817,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "Watch three cooking videos, you'll likely see more cooking."
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 194.704,
      "end": 197.52,
      "startFrame": 5841,
      "endFrame": 5926,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "Watch those, and the next guess leans harder."
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 198.32,
      "end": 201.136,
      "startFrame": 5950,
      "endFrame": 6034,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "You watch, it learns, it offers more of that."
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 201.936,
      "end": 204.219,
      "startFrame": 6058,
      "endFrame": 6127,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "The circle can get smaller and smaller."
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 205.019,
      "end": 207.6,
      "startFrame": 6151,
      "endFrame": 6228,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "That's why two people can open the same app"
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 208.4,
      "end": 210.853,
      "startFrame": 6252,
      "endFrame": 6326,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "and see two completely different worlds."
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 211.653,
      "end": 214.576,
      "startFrame": 6350,
      "endFrame": 6437,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "It's not evil, and it doesn't trap everyone."
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 215.376,
      "end": 218.171,
      "startFrame": 6461,
      "endFrame": 6545,
      "words": 7,
      "text": "It's just doing its job: guessing well."
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 218.971,
      "end": 221.253,
      "startFrame": 6569,
      "endFrame": 6638,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "But that means your quick taps are votes."
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 222.053,
      "end": 223.888,
      "startFrame": 6662,
      "endFrame": 6717,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Even the ones you didn't mean."
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 224.888,
      "end": 227.747,
      "startFrame": 6747,
      "endFrame": 6832,
      "words": 9,
      "text": "So can you vote back? Yes. With three taps."
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 228.547,
      "end": 230.872,
      "startFrame": 6856,
      "endFrame": 6926,
      "words": 6,
      "text": "Tap one: open your watch history."
    },
